PICS 0
BACnet Protocol Implementation Conformance Statement
Vendor Name: "Chipkin Automation Systems"
Product Name: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-SS (Python)"
Product Model Number: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-SS"
Product Description: "A minimal read-only BACnet/IP sensing device built on the CAS BACnet Stack. It presents three sensor objects (Analog Input, Binary Input, Multi-State Input) whose readings follow a sensor Simulation, answers ReadProperty for every required property of every object, reports a broken sensor through Analog Input 1's Reliability and the FAULT bit of Status_Flags, and is discoverable by Who-Is / I-Am and Who-Has / I-Have. It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-SS profile."

BACnet Standardized Device Profiles Supported:
{
B-SS - BACnet Smart Sensor
}

BIBBs Supported:
{
DS-RP-B
DM-DDB-B
DM-DOB-B
}

BACnet Standard Application Services Supported:
{
ReadProperty Execute
IAm Initiate
IHave Initiate
WhoHas Execute
WhoIs Execute
}

Standard Object Types Supported:
{
Analog Input
Binary Input
Device
Multi-state Input
Network Port
}

Data Link Layer Option:
{
BACnet IP, (Annex J)
}

Character Sets Supported:
{
ISO 10646 (UTF-8) / ANSI X3.4
}

Special Functionality:
{
Maximum APDU size in octets: 1476
Segmented Requests Supported, window size: 1
Segmented Responses Supported, window size: 1
}

Default Property Value Restrictions:
{
unsigned-integer: <minimum: 0; maximum: 65535>
signed-integer: <minimum: -2147483648; maximum: 2147483647>
real: <minimum: -3.4e+38; maximum: 3.4e+38; resolution: 0.01>
character-string: <maximum length string: 64>
octet-string: <maximum length string: 256>
list: <maximum length list: 10>
}

Fail Times:
{
Notification Fail Time: 60
Internal Processing Fail Time: 2
Minimum ON/OFF Time: 2
Schedule Evaluation Fail Time: 2
External Command Fail Time: 5
Program Object State Change Fail Time: 5
Acknowledgement Fail Time: 2
Slave Proxy Confirm Interval: 6
Unconfirmed Response Fail Time: 4
Activate Changes Fail Time: 30
Auto Negotiation Fail Time: 15
Foreign Device Registration Fail Time: 10
Channel Write Fail Time: 30
}

